= The Armistice in the West

On 11 November 1918, Germany signed the Armistice. The Kaiser has fled, and a socialist republic has been proclaimed in Berlin. The Russian Republic has outlasted the war.

The army is being demobilised, and the soldiers go home with their weapons. The cost of the war is a debt that the Allies expect Russia to honour.
